{"fps": 30, "frames": 1778, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 189, "text": "In nineteen twenty-six, a stock sold for sixty-five dollars with ninety-five in cash inside.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 0, "e": 5}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 6, "e": 21}, {"w": "twenty-six,", "f": 22, "e": 43}, {"w": "a", "f": 44, "e": 47}, {"w": "stock", "f": 48, "e": 58}, {"w": "sold", "f": 59, "e": 68}, {"w": "for", "f": 68, "e": 75}, {"w": "sixty-five", "f": 76, "e": 95}, {"w": "dollars", "f": 96, "e": 110}, {"w": "with", "f": 111, "e": 119}, {"w": "ninety-five", "f": 120, "e": 142}, {"w": "in", "f": 142, "e": 147}, {"w": "cash", "f": 148, "e": 156}, {"w": "inside.", "f": 157, "e": 171}]}, {"a": 189, "b": 330, "text": "Imagine you're Benjamin Graham, reading dull pipeline reports in Washington.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 191, "e": 202}, {"w": "you're", "f": 203, "e": 213}, {"w": "Benjamin", "f": 214, "e": 226}, {"w": "Graham,", "f": 227, "e": 246}, {"w": "reading", "f": 247, "e": 258}, {"w": "dull", "f": 259, "e": 266}, {"w": "pipeline", "f": 267, "e": 280}, {"w": "reports", "f": 280, "e": 292}, {"w": "in", "f": 293, "e": 296}, {"w": "Washington.", "f": 297, "e": 314}]}, {"a": 330, "b": 389, "text": "Wall Street never opens these. Too boring.", "words": [{"w": "Wall", "f": 332, "e": 337}, {"w": "Street", "f": 338, "e": 345}, {"w": "never", "f": 346, "e": 352}, {"w": "opens", "f": 353, "e": 359}, {"w": "these.", "f": 360, "e": 367}, {"w": "Too", "f": 368, "e": 372}, {"w": "boring.", "f": 373, "e": 381}]}, {"a": 389, "b": 504, "text": "Then you spot Northern Pipe Line, a Standard Oil spin-off.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 391, "e": 397}, {"w": "you", "f": 398, "e": 403}, {"w": "spot", "f": 404, "e": 410}, {"w": "Northern", "f": 411, "e": 443}, {"w": "Pipe", "f": 444, "e": 450}, {"w": "Line,", "f": 451, "e": 459}, {"w": "a", "f": 460, "e": 462}, {"w": "Standard", "f": 463, "e": 475}, {"w": "Oil", "f": 476, "e": 481}, {"w": "spin-off.", "f": 482, "e": 495}]}, {"a": 504, "b": 692, "text": "Its 